			<tr><th id="1">1. ニホンアマガエル</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru014.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru014_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru014.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru015.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru015_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru015.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru016.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru016_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru016.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru017.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru017_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru017.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru018.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru018_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru018.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：木下隆志<br />
				<br />
				アマガエルはのどを膨らませた姿で造形。<br />
				のどの透け感を塗装で表現している点はお見事。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="2">2. ニホンヒキガエル</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru019.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru019_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru019.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru020.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru020_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru020.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru021.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru021_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru021.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru022.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru022_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru022.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru023.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru023_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru023.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：寺岡邦明<br />
				<br />
				イボイボ、ヒダヒダなヒキガエルの特徴をうまくディフォルメしたフィギュア。<br />
				日本の動物シリーズでフィギュア化されたヒキガエルは「ミヤコヒキガエル」だけでした。<br />
				</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="3">3. オタマジャクシの太陰図</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru024.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru024_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru024.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru025.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru025_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru025.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru026.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru026_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru026.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：山本聖士<br />
				<br />
				通常のオタマジャクシとアルビノのオタマジャクシを太陰図の構図でフィギュア化。<br />
				腹には吸盤をイメージした渦巻きが。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->			
			<tr><th id="4">4. アメフクラガエル</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru001.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru001_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru001.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru002.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru002_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru002.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru003.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru003_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru003.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：松本栄一郎<br />
				<br />
				海洋堂からは初のフィギュア化。<br />
				大福餅のように丸っこいボディのため、このシリーズと相性がよい。</td></tr>
			<!--
			-->
			<tr><th id="5">5. リマニーヤドクガエル（赤）</th></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru009.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru009_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru009.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru010.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru010_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru010.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td><a href="img/osaifugaeru011.jpg">
				<img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru011_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru011.jpg" --></a><a href="img/osaifugaeru012.jpg"><img height="283" src="img/osaifugaeru012_small.jpg" width="378" /><!-- MSComment="autothumbnail" xthumbnail-orig-image="file:///G:/My Web Sites/mysite2/kaiyodo_Capsule/CapQ/osaifugaeru1/img/osaifugaeru012.jpg" --></a></td></tr>
			<tr><td class="comment">原型制作：山本聖士<br />
				<br />
				海洋堂からはこれまでに<a href="../../../anima/chocoq_amazing">イチゴヤドクガエル</a>、<a href="../../../aqua/zuroku/zuroku4">マダラヤドクガエル</a>が製品化されていました。<br />
				リマニーヤドクガエルは今回初めて。</td></tr>
